mple: The building is based on a sketch by Frank Lloyd Wright."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "drawing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a picture made with pen or pencil"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can see his drawings near the entrance."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "material"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the substance from which a thing is made"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The materials in the building reflect the architect's vision."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "spiral"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a shape that coils around a central point"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's start our tour at the top of the spiral staircase."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "staircase "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a set of stairs to go up or down in a building "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The exhibit is all around the staircase."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "collection"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "works of art that are connected in some way "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The Guggenheim has a great American collection."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob05aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le13ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Asking and Giving Directions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use <span class =\"strong\">Wh-questions</span> to ask for directions in a building like a museum. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the Imperative, expressions and prepositions of place to give directions."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Asking for Directions </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Giving Directions </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Where does/is/are\u2026 ?<br />    How do I get to\u2026?<br />    Where can I\u2026?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Let's\u2026<br />  Follow me.<br /> Turn right/left.<br /> Walk across the lobby.<br /> Take the stairs/elevator<br /> Exit...</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Ann</span>: Where does the tour start?<br /><span class =\"strong\">Guide</span>: Let's start at the top of the spiral staircase."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Ann</span>: How do I get to the gift shop?<br /> <span class =\"strong\">Guide</span>: It's beside the exit doors. Continue all the way down to the main floor."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online. Visit http://www.guggenheim.org/newyork for information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a report (5-8 lines) about the museum."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe the museum."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write about 2 or 3 collections you can find there."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Would you recommend the museum to your friends? Why or why not?"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify